---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="About Sameer Shams | Founder of Deliverio Express" description="Meet Sameer Shams, founder of Deliverio Express. Since 2019, his hands-on delivery experience and software engineering background have shaped a better way to handle parcels and COD." canonical="/about/">
  <section class="page-hero about-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">ABOUT DELIVERIO EXPRESS</p>
      <h1>Built from the<br /><em>ground up.</em></h1>
      <p>Delivery experience from the street, combined with systems built for sellers.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section founder-section">
    <div class="container founder-story">
      <div class="founder-photo-placeholder" role="img" aria-label="Space reserved for a photo of founder Sameer Shams">
        <span class="founder-initials" aria-hidden="true">SS</span>
        <span class="founder-photo-label">Founder photo</span>
      </div>
      <div class="founder-story-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">THE PERSON BEHIND THE PARCELS</p>
        <h2>Sameer Shams</h2>
        <p class="founder-role">Founder, Deliverio Express · Software Engineer</p>
        <p>I’m Sameer Shams, founder of Deliverio Express. I have worked in Pakistan’s delivery industry since 2019: on the ground with Bykea, Foodpanda, Daraz and PostEx, and running local courier deliveries on my own. I am also a software engineer.</p>
        <p>That combination is why Deliverio Express is different. I have seen how deliveries actually fail: wrong addresses, customers who don’t answer, and COD money that reaches sellers late. So I built our own system to record every parcel, every delivery attempt and every rupee of COD, instead of relying on notebooks and memory.</p>
        <p>We call your customer before delivery, record the reason for every failed attempt, and pay your COD within 24 hours of delivery.</p>
        <div class="founder-principles" aria-label="Our delivery process">
          <span>Every parcel recorded</span>
          <span>Every attempt tracked</span>
          <span>COD paid within 24 hours</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
